# Docker build context excludes.
#
# Every image builds from the REPOSITORY ROOT, because an example's deno.json maps only the
# packages it imports directly — `@setu-ts/common` reaches `packages/kernel` through the root
# workspace, so an image without `deno.json` at its root fails to resolve it (see
# plans/archive/milestone-39-docker-kubernetes.md §3.1). A root context is therefore mandatory,
# which makes trimming it here worth real build time.

.git
.github
.claude

# Generated API documentation: ~380 KB of HTML that no image ever reads.
docs/api

# Test and coverage output.
coverage
**/cov_profile

# Frontend build output and npm trees (apps/full-stack). Regenerated by the build that needs them.
**/node_modules
apps/*/build
apps/*/.wrangler

# Compiled binaries produced by `deno task compile` outside Docker.
apps/compiled-binary/hono-example

# Editor and OS noise.
.vscode
.idea
**/.DS_Store
